# Design Capability

This capability provides 6 focused design modes. Select the mode appropriate for the current design task.

## Modes

| Mode | Skill | When to Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `audit` | design-audit | Diagnose why a UI feels generic, uneven, or hard to validate |
| `arrange` | design-arrange | Repair layout, spacing, and visual rhythm |
| `bold` | design-bolder | Increase visual conviction when UI is safe or bland |
| `distill` | design-distill | Remove clutter and reduce visual noise |
| `polish` | design-polish | Final design cleanup pass on a functionally complete UI |
| `typeset` | design-typeset | Repair or strengthen typography and type-scale |
| `context-capture` | design-context-capture | Capture or refresh canonical design context in docs/foundation/DESIGN.md |

